  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Rural Development Strategy for the National Center for Rural Development and Durable Solutions in Somalia.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the development of the National Rural Development Strategy, technical assistance to the government are:

-	Consultations to develop a shared understanding among all stakeholders regarding the vision,
scope, and key components of the strategy.
-	Facilitate the inclusion of best practices, innovative approaches, and critical considerations for effective rural development
-	Ground the new National Rural Development Strategy in current rural realities, the Rapid Rural Assessment (RRA), and key stakeholder insights to inform the strategy?s formulation
-	Identify concrete next steps, responsibilities, and commitments required for the successful development and subsequent implementation of the strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
